  "description": "A fully managed audio library for playing, recording, and analyzing sound. Reads and plays common audio file formats like WAV, MP3, Ogg Vorbis, and FLAC, plays MIDI music through SoundFont, SFZ or Decent Sampler instruments, plays several tracks as one song - including a stems download, where each part can play as its recording or as its MIDI performance - and includes a small set of signal-processing tools for analyzing audio. Also includes a full audio engine for recording, editing, mixing, and effects, with no platform-specific setup required.",
